@title Route all: wires run through the ducts and end on their terminals
@area Cabinet
# Example project, Cabinet > Place all > Route all wires. Every wire leaves a terminal, runs in the ducts and arrives at a terminal; wires no duct reaches are listed, not drawn straight across the plate.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text place all
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Route all wires
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
shot routed
check_layout
check_blank routed
